{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/torvalds/linux/compare/master...19f94b39058681dec64a10ebeb6f23fe7fc3f77a","html_url":"https://github.com/torvalds/linux/compare/master...19f94b39058681dec64a10ebeb6f23fe7fc3f77a","permalink_url":"https://github.com/torvalds/linux/compare/torvalds:f802b65...torvalds:19f94b3","diff_url":"https://github.com/torvalds/linux/compare/master...19f94b39058681dec64a10ebeb6f23fe7fc3f77a.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/torvalds/linux/compare/master...19f94b39058681dec64a10ebeb6f23fe7fc3f77a.patch","base_commit":{"sha":"f802b6558eb81bd5888d761a0cdc8afe5fd8c941","node_id":"C_kwDOACN7MtoAKGY4MDJiNjU1OGViODFiZDU4ODhkNzYxYTBjZGM4YWZlNWZkOGM5NDE","commit":{"author":{"name":"Linus Torvalds","email":"torvalds@linux-foundation.org","date":"2026-11-21T23:36:04Z"},"committer":{"name":"Linus Torvalds","email":"torvalds@linux-foundation.org","date":"2026-11-21T23:36:04Z"},"message":"Merge tag 'xfs-fixes-7.4-rc4' of git://git.kernel.org:/pub/scm/fs/xfs/xfs-linux\n\nPull xfs fixes from Carlos Maiolino:\n \"Mostly this includes fixes for a few races, an ordering problem during\n  init/teardown of proc/sysfs, missing locks, etc\"\n\n* tag 'xfs-fixes-7.4-rc4' of git://git.kernel.org:/pub/scm/fs/xfs/xfs-linux:\n  xfs: test for realtime and reflink under the pNFS locks\n  xfs: don't enable DAX on zoned inodes\n  xfs: restart faults racing with realtime flag changes\n  xfs: take the MMAPLOCK in xfs_fileattr_set()\n  xfs: refuse fallocate racing with realtime flag changes\n  xfs: test for always COW after the dio write checks\n  xfs: refuse writes to files racing with realtime inode flag changes\n  xfs: test for reflink after the dio write checks\n  xfs: properly order xfsstats proc/sysfs init and teardown\n  xfs: remove unused variable in xrep_tempfile_copyin()\n  xfs: remove unused variable in xchk_stats_estimate_bufsize()\n  xfs: fix f_bfree underflow in statfs()\n  xfs: wait for direct I/O before swapping extents\n  xfs: break layouts before swapping extents\n  iomap: don't punch delalloc under a dirty EOF block\n  xfs: don't change the block map under a dirty folio\n  xfs: flush the shifted range before changing the file\n  xfs: don't skip the flush before shifting extents\n  xfs: always call xfs_update_stable_writes in xfs_ioctl_setattr_xflags\n  xfs: keep successful near rt allocations","tree":{"sha":"15dca1b3e51cc361db1e1376f3f9c4cebefaf747","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/torvalds/linux/git/trees/15dca1b3e51cc361db1e1376f3f9c4cebefaf747"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/torvalds/linux/git/commits/f802b6558eb81bd5888d761a0cdc8afe5fd8c941","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/torvalds/linux/commits/f802b6558eb81bd5888d761a0cdc8afe5fd8c941","html_url":"https://github.com/torvalds/linux/commit/f802b6558eb81bd5888d761a0cdc8afe5fd8c941","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/torvalds/linux/commits/f802b6558eb81bd5888d761a0cdc8afe5fd8c941/comments","author":{"login":"torvalds","id":1024025,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMjQwMjU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1024025?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/torvalds","html_url":"https://github.com/torvalds","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/torvalds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/torvalds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/torvalds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/torvalds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/torvalds/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/torvalds/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/torvalds/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/torvalds/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/torvalds/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer